== Trivia ==
*'''Vreike''' has no dialogue unless having purchased [[Lazarus]]'s tip. After talking to them, they will no longer give dialogue.
*'''Vreike''' does, however, display text above their head, as if communicating with the other [[NPC]]s in the {{zone|Shifted Tavern}}.
*'''Vreike''' was originally created as a player character for [[w:Dungeons_&_Dragons|Dungeons and Dragons]] by Planet Minecraft User [https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/drzzter/| Drzzter].

